			</div>
			<div class="content" id="post-content-4852166">
									

<p>Seeking Greenlights:** Yes.</p>
<p>Page Type: SCP Article</p>
<p>Genre: Horror/Comedy</p>
<p><strong>Elevator Pitch:</strong> A teenager name &quot;Janual Grey&quot; that one day discovers that he's no longer human after an unexplained blackout while he and his friends are at Acadia National Park, and later on woke up and finds himself as a space, time, and reality-altering eldritch abomination.</p>
<div class="collapsible-block">
<div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">+&nbsp;show&nbsp;block</a></div>
<div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none">
<div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">–&nbsp;hide&nbsp;block</a></div>
<div class="collapsible-block-content">
<p>Janual still acts like a regular human. However, discovering his powers has made a few changes. He begins to possess numerous anomalous properties that not even he knows how many does he has. Every 24 hours passes by. If Janual doesn't consume any food that gives him the nutrition he needs, he will get driven into a state of absolute hostility, where he would go on a never-ending frenzy to satisfy his hunger, which of course that time he would begin to use more of his anomalous properties to lure humans deep into the woods. Which is why he usually lures bad peoples into his territory and consumes them.</p>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<br />
<strong>Central Narrative:</strong>
<div class="collapsible-block">
<div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">+&nbsp;show&nbsp;block</a></div>
<div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none">
<div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">–&nbsp;hide&nbsp;block</a></div>
<div class="collapsible-block-content">
<p>The main point here is that:</p>
<p>Janual wasn't actually a human at all. Janual was originally born like this already. His father was a cosmic eldritch deity worshiped by a cult named &quot;Servants of &quot;Darkness&quot; &quot; secretly built under a church where his mother as a nun is, the cult mainly focuses on worshiping a deity named &quot;Darkness&quot;. When the cult let his father manifest into reality, he disguised himself as a handsome human and seduced his mother into having a child. After borning out Janual, he de-manifested himself out of reality to let his son, Janual, destroy the world instead of him. However, due to embodying human natures, Janual didn't become malevolent as his father was.</p>
<p>After a few years, when Janual's mother has raised him, she had witnessed him consume their neighbors in his monstrous form. As she started to find answers to why her son is like this, she soon discovers the truth. She could find a way to seal his powers from being unleashed due to worrying that he might bring apocalyptic events. However, during the past years, she slowly forgets that she must check and renew the seal.</p>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<br />
<strong>Hook/Attention-Grabber:</strong> Janual is a friend in school with SCP-105 and is familiar with SCP-4051 as they've met each other before being held in Foundation custody.
<p><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> Draft is almost finished.</p>

